# Files under bench/ that are archives or over 256 KiB, each kept at this exact blob: benchmark
# output whose paths are cited (removing it at the tip would shrink no full clone, since its blobs
# stay reachable in history). A dependency lock file at a path in LOCKS in scripts/bench-size.mjs,
# beside its manifest, is source input, and the size limit skips it.
# The list only shrinks: scripts/bench-size.mjs fails on a line not in the base's list at the same
# path and blob (CONTRIBUTING.md, Benchmark results). One "<blob ID> <path>" per line, sorted by path.
